- [Vonage Video API Documentation](https://developer.vonage.com/en/video/overview) — In-depth guides for the Video API.
- [vonage-video-ios-app on GitHub](https://github.com/Vonage/vonage-video-ios-app) — Source code, full README with all configuration options, and contribution guidelines.
